== contraction lemmas ==
OK   every cut of G/{u,v} is a cut of G with exactly the same crossing edges (300 random multigraphs)
OK   contraction never decreases the minimum cut
OK   contracting uv increases the minimum cut iff uv crosses every minimum cut
